# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tables and per-image files are ignored by default. WBCBench2026 images, labels
# and per-image predictions must never be committed (competition rules; Data
# availability). Only the public evidence named below is re-included: count-only
# WBCBench aggregates, internal confusion matrices, leave-one-dataset-out files of
# the public training sources, two hash lists, the cited summary tables and the
# manifest. Anything regenerated under analysis/ stays ignored unless listed here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.csv
*.csv.gz

